WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:38.490 --> 01:40.960
Finally, I got rid of that bed-head.

01:43.060 --> 01:50.040
Aah, it's such a pain, trying to fix my hair
every morning. What can I do about it?

01:50.040 --> 01:52.420
Huh? The mail order catalogue?

01:53.310 --> 01:56.340
I wonder if there are any magical
hair treatments in here.

01:58.710 --> 02:00.280
"Glossy Macaroon.

02:00.280 --> 02:06.150
Eat just one, and your hair will be trouble-free and glossy! Your popularity will skyrocket!"?

02:06.150 --> 02:07.960
This! This is perfect!

02:09.260 --> 02:11.330
200 ecure, huh?

02:11.330 --> 02:15.000
Once my popularity is up, I will get lots of orange
hearts and the 200 ecure will pay for itself!

02:15.900 --> 02:16.660
Alright! I'll get it!

02:18.700 --> 02:21.070
The Topsy-Turvy Macaroon Disaster!?

02:22.970 --> 02:27.330
One, two, three, four, five, six!

02:28.110 --> 02:29.680
Sugar Sugar Rune!

02:42.320 --> 02:44.390
How ya'll doing? I'm from the Magical
World Mail Order Catalogue.

02:44.930 --> 02:45.930
It came! It came!

02:46.630 --> 02:48.400
Here are the macaroons you ordered.

02:49.030 --> 02:49.800
Thank you!

02:50.970 --> 02:52.200
Have a good one!

02:54.370 --> 02:55.740
Well then!

02:57.670 --> 02:59.070
Chocolat-chan, good morning!

02:59.910 --> 03:01.210
Good morning! That's right!

03:01.540 --> 03:03.280
I'll give Vanilla one, too!

03:03.280 --> 03:03.610
Eh?

03:04.010 --> 03:05.160
Ta-da!

03:05.160 --> 03:08.620
I bought magic macaroons that will give you
glossy and shiny hair, boosting your popularity!

03:08.620 --> 03:13.590
Cool! But is that okay? You paid for it...

03:14.320 --> 03:18.590
No problem! You let me copy your
homework five times last week!

03:19.130 --> 03:20.630
Thank you, Chocolat-chan!

03:23.770 --> 03:24.430
So!

03:24.430 --> 03:26.130
Bon appetit!

03:29.740 --> 03:30.870
Yummy!

03:32.910 --> 03:33.570
What's this?!

03:34.010 --> 03:34.880
It's so bright!

03:49.960 --> 03:51.730
What was that all about?

03:51.730 --> 03:53.990
Aah! That scared me!

03:58.470 --> 03:59.930
There's a double of me!

04:02.300 --> 04:03.070
No way.

04:04.410 --> 04:05.440
It can't be.

04:06.910 --> 04:07.980
Vanilla's–

04:07.980 --> 04:08.940
Chocolat-chan's–

04:09.280 --> 04:10.840
WE'VE BEEN SWITCHED!

04:12.510 --> 04:14.450
H-h-how could this happen?!

04:15.020 --> 04:18.490
Chocolat-chan, this says that these
are topsy-turvy macaroons!

04:18.920 --> 04:20.920
Eh? Topsy-turvy macaroons?

04:22.020 --> 04:26.260
It reads: "This macaroon switches any
two that eat it at the same time."

04:26.590 --> 04:30.760
No way.
I ordered the "glossy hair" macaroons!

04:31.830 --> 04:33.270
I gave them the wrong order number.

04:33.800 --> 04:34.800
Oh, no!

04:39.210 --> 04:42.280
Well, we still kept our own pendants.

04:42.680 --> 04:47.450
Wow, so the one thing we got from Queen Candy
can't be manipulated by the macaroon's magic.

04:47.850 --> 04:50.280
This isn't the time to be impressed.

04:51.090 --> 04:54.090
We'll be able to change back
to our original selves, right?

04:54.090 --> 04:55.480
Vanilla-chama!

04:55.990 --> 04:58.530
Hurry and get ready or you'll be late!

04:59.090 --> 05:02.330
Quit your "chu-chu"-ing
so freaking early! I'll whup your butt!

05:03.560 --> 05:10.850
V-V-Vanilla-chama! That crass manner is like
Chocolat's... what's the meaning of this!?

05:11.410 --> 05:13.070
I said...

05:13.470 --> 05:16.380
Shut up, you overly made-up rat!

05:22.020 --> 05:22.880
Blanca!!!

05:23.450 --> 05:29.720
Kero-kero! Vanilla's like Chocolat, Chocolat's like Vanilla. What's going on-kero?

05:30.430 --> 05:30.890
Duke!

05:31.260 --> 05:31.660
Kero?

05:32.360 --> 05:35.660
It's nothing really. Don't worry!

05:36.930 --> 05:40.630
This gentle, sweet Chocolat... what a first!

05:41.940 --> 05:43.670
What're you being all mushy for?!

05:44.710 --> 05:46.090
I'll whup your butt!

05:46.090 --> 05:47.740
Wait-kero!

05:49.680 --> 05:53.210
The manual doesn't say
how to change back!

05:53.210 --> 05:57.850
It'll be fine. We'll change back
sooner or later!

05:58.140 --> 05:59.120
You think so?

05:59.590 --> 06:03.390
It only cost 200 ecure, so it can't last that long!

06:04.330 --> 06:05.090
You have a point.

06:05.560 --> 06:08.700
So for today, we'll just have fun
pretending to be each other.

06:09.200 --> 06:11.830
Mmh! I get the feeling being
Chocolat-chan will be fun!

06:12.400 --> 06:14.600
And I'm sure being Vanilla for a day will be fun, too!

06:16.140 --> 06:19.510
That's right! Since they'll see me as Vanilla,
I'll be able to get lots of hearts!

06:23.710 --> 06:24.640
Good morning!

06:25.380 --> 06:26.610
Good morning!

06:27.120 --> 06:28.650
Good morning!

06:29.780 --> 06:31.390
Now, heart-snatching time!

06:33.490 --> 06:35.520
Check out Momo-ma's messy hair!

06:37.410 --> 06:41.760
Cut it out! How rude!
I'm gonna whup your butt!

06:43.730 --> 06:44.700
Holy...

06:46.470 --> 06:49.700
Wh-what's happened to Vanilla-chan?!

06:51.140 --> 06:52.040
Yes, that's it!

06:52.040 --> 06:54.680
Just as I expected, only Vanilla
could get this sort of reaction!

06:55.640 --> 06:56.780
Agrandissment!

06:58.180 --> 07:00.680
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

07:15.360 --> 07:15.830
Wand!

07:24.890 --> 07:25.570
Alright!

07:27.440 --> 07:30.740
Your heart... Pick up!

07:41.760 --> 07:42.920
Pee-colored only.

07:43.290 --> 07:44.760
How come?

07:48.200 --> 07:51.030
Now everyone thinks
I said "whup your butt"!

07:52.030 --> 07:53.800
How embarrassing!

07:53.800 --> 07:55.940
Kato has tears in her eyes!

07:55.940 --> 07:57.470
That's unexpected.

07:57.910 --> 07:58.910
Isn't she cute?!

08:05.210 --> 08:05.920
A heart!

08:07.980 --> 08:11.220
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

08:13.960 --> 08:14.420
Wand!

08:15.960 --> 08:17.960
Hearts, Hearts, please come to me!

08:28.200 --> 08:29.140
I did it!

08:31.010 --> 08:32.370
W-why?!

08:37.980 --> 08:41.950
Weird! Everything I pick up is pee-colored!

08:42.350 --> 08:47.050
Awesome! As Chocolat-chan, picking
up orange hearts is a piece of cake!

08:47.050 --> 08:47.920
Hey.

08:48.260 --> 08:50.260
Aren't those two acting strange?

08:50.690 --> 08:53.290
Their personalities are totally off.

08:55.030 --> 08:56.430
They're gossiping about us.

08:56.800 --> 08:58.530
Really strange, isn't it?

08:59.030 --> 09:00.970
Kato is strangely quiet.

09:01.340 --> 09:04.470
And Ice is as ferocious as Kato.

09:05.470 --> 09:06.440
"Ferocious?"

09:07.140 --> 09:09.380
Hey, I think I know why they're acting weird.

09:12.150 --> 09:15.620
They must have switched bodies!

09:16.620 --> 09:18.860
They must've beamed up to their
mothership last night

09:18.860 --> 09:21.860
and gone into their
personality-switcher machine!

09:23.990 --> 09:25.260
Right, right.

09:25.260 --> 09:26.990
Whatever, whatever.

09:26.990 --> 09:29.300
What're you doing? You guys!

09:29.860 --> 09:32.400
Thank goodness no one ever believes Akira.

09:32.870 --> 09:36.100
But this is tiring, being switched like this.

09:36.540 --> 09:39.610
Yeah. I'm really wanting to change back now!

09:40.410 --> 09:45.410
Chocolat-chan, please keep in mind that I have
to meet up with Natsume-chan and the others!

09:45.950 --> 09:48.820
Oh! And I have to meet with Akira and the others!

09:50.120 --> 09:51.690
Here it comes, Taiji!

09:52.090 --> 09:56.720
Wah! Chocolat-chan, how could you
promise to do something like this?!

09:59.660 --> 10:02.700
I can't play soccer!

10:06.120 --> 10:08.970
Vanilla, how could you promise to do this?!

10:09.770 --> 10:12.840
I don't have a clue about embroidery!

10:13.510 --> 10:15.580
Vanilla-chan, hurry up and show us!

10:16.610 --> 10:19.750
Ah! Uh... like this!

10:23.670 --> 10:25.420
Ouch!

10:26.050 --> 10:27.290
There's a shock.

10:27.690 --> 10:30.920
Vanilla-chan is in fact quite a klutz.

10:31.360 --> 10:32.490
Why, you...!

10:37.700 --> 10:41.500
Vanilla-chan, I thought you were
going to teach us embroidery.

10:43.370 --> 10:45.240
I'm scared! I'm scared! I'm scared!

10:46.440 --> 10:47.740
Alright! Kato!

10:55.820 --> 10:56.750
Kato!

10:57.220 --> 10:58.220
Wait a sec!

10:58.590 --> 11:00.190
What the hell are you doing?!

11:00.620 --> 11:05.260
Receiving the ball with your face?! Stand up!

11:05.260 --> 11:06.850
Vanilla-chan...

11:07.160 --> 11:08.290
Whoa...

11:08.700 --> 11:10.960
Ice's all fired up today.

11:12.030 --> 11:14.820
Their souls must have been
switched by the aliens...

11:15.900 --> 11:19.360
Chocolat-chan, this is humiliating!

11:19.670 --> 11:21.780
Don't be such a crybaby!

11:24.710 --> 11:26.580
Those two are acting strange.

11:27.150 --> 11:27.510
Yeah.

11:40.390 --> 11:43.260
If this keeps up, I'm gonna be sick!

11:43.800 --> 11:45.430
I can't take this, either!

11:49.100 --> 11:50.100
The instructions?

11:52.040 --> 11:52.870
Two pages?

11:53.310 --> 11:53.970
Eh?

11:53.970 --> 11:55.610
There were two pages.

11:58.480 --> 11:59.150
What is it?

11:59.680 --> 12:01.880
It says... it says how to return!

12:02.250 --> 12:02.820
Really?

12:03.420 --> 12:06.790
It says if we eat the topsy-turvy macaroon
again, we can return to normal!

12:07.150 --> 12:07.990
Oh really?

12:07.990 --> 12:09.460
Okay! Lets hurry home, then!

12:15.460 --> 12:17.670
You two, class is starting!

12:17.670 --> 12:19.070
Goin' home early!

12:19.070 --> 12:21.170
Sorry, teacher!

12:25.610 --> 12:32.210
Ah, why has my adorable Vanilla-chama
become like Chocolat?

12:32.680 --> 12:34.440
Are you not having lunch-kero?

12:34.620 --> 12:37.720
The shock has killed my appetite.

12:38.320 --> 12:39.150
Well, then...

12:39.750 --> 12:42.190
I'll polish off these desserts myself!

12:42.190 --> 12:43.560
Don't you dare!

12:43.560 --> 12:46.530
Sweets are best eaten in a state of shock!

12:46.530 --> 12:49.460
Fine then, let's each have one.

12:50.300 --> 12:51.500
Let's dig in!

12:51.500 --> 12:52.870
Bon appetit-chu!

13:03.680 --> 13:05.580
What was that-kero?

13:05.580 --> 13:08.690
It was blinding-chu!

13:10.620 --> 13:13.250
There's another one of me!

13:16.260 --> 13:19.330
I've become a tacky striped frog-chu!

13:19.330 --> 13:21.930
I've become a white rat-kero!

13:24.300 --> 13:25.770
We're ho– huh?

13:27.500 --> 13:29.870
Unbelieveable-kero!

13:29.870 --> 13:30.740
It can't be.

13:32.710 --> 13:34.040
We were too late!

13:34.040 --> 13:36.240
Th-they ate the macaroons?!

13:36.740 --> 13:37.940
I understand now!

13:38.350 --> 13:42.550
The reason you were so rude this morning
was that you two had switched!

13:42.980 --> 13:46.260
Chocolat! You must explain yourself kero!

13:46.990 --> 13:47.890
Shut up!

13:47.890 --> 13:50.160
You have no right to boss me around
after eating MY macaroons!

13:51.430 --> 13:53.790
Now we can't turn back to normal!

13:54.200 --> 13:56.480
What?! Can't turn back?!

13:58.570 --> 13:59.730
Fortune-telling book?

14:00.070 --> 14:02.370
Your reliable partner when you are in trouble.

14:02.370 --> 14:04.770
I am the fortune-telling book!

14:04.770 --> 14:06.540
Then tell me what we have to do!

14:08.240 --> 14:10.540
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

14:11.980 --> 14:14.150
Divination! Livre!

14:16.480 --> 14:19.990
Tell me how to change back!

14:27.490 --> 14:28.930
A wonderful gift!

14:30.100 --> 14:34.200
Shopping today might bring you good luck!

14:39.410 --> 14:41.790
Stop kidding around! I'll whup your butt!

14:42.240 --> 14:43.840
Wait! Chocolat-chan!

14:43.840 --> 14:44.710
Don't stop me!

14:44.710 --> 14:49.020
We just have to order topsy-turvy macaroons again.

14:50.520 --> 14:52.220
Vanilla! You're a genius!

14:52.890 --> 14:57.060
One! Two! Three! Four! Five! Six!

14:57.490 --> 14:58.420
Sugar Sugar Rune!

15:16.380 --> 15:18.850
Unfortunately the item you requested is out of stock.

15:18.850 --> 15:20.910
It has been placed on back-order and
will be delivered in one month.

15:23.420 --> 15:24.510
One month...

15:26.790 --> 15:31.230
I can't take being in such a vulgar
body for one month!

15:31.230 --> 15:33.030
Hey! That's my line-kero!

15:33.430 --> 15:35.860
Chocolat-chan! What'll we do?!

15:35.860 --> 15:37.600
I don't know what to do, either!

15:41.070 --> 15:42.600
Now I know, Chocolat!

15:43.070 --> 15:44.790
You did this on PURPOSE!

15:46.310 --> 15:47.640
It's no use hiding it!

15:48.340 --> 15:52.180
You must have planned to switch with
Vanilla-chama this whole time,

15:52.670 --> 15:56.810
and had Vanilla-chama eat the macaroons
with you so you could get tons of hearts!

15:57.180 --> 15:58.920
Wh-what are you talking about?!

15:58.920 --> 15:59.790
I see...

16:01.390 --> 16:02.360
Chocolat-chan.

16:04.330 --> 16:06.320
Do you think I would do such a thing?!

16:07.590 --> 16:11.370
If you'd found page two of the
instructions this morning,

16:11.370 --> 16:13.230
this never would have happened!

16:14.640 --> 16:18.970
You're the one that gave the wrong
order number in the first place!

16:19.510 --> 16:21.680
Oh, I can't take this anymore!

16:21.680 --> 16:24.580
Don't cry in my body! It looks lame!

16:24.580 --> 16:27.380
Don't shout at me with my body, it's freaky!

16:28.150 --> 16:30.450
It's your fault, you make me want to shout at you!

16:30.450 --> 16:32.090
Why do you cry so easily?!

16:32.090 --> 16:36.390
Why are you so violent and short-tempered?!

16:36.920 --> 16:38.730
Well excuse me for being violent!

16:38.730 --> 16:41.400
It's better than being a wimpy coward!

16:41.730 --> 16:44.400
"A wimpy coward"!?

16:44.930 --> 16:46.670
You're so mean!

16:48.300 --> 16:49.440
You're still crying?!

16:49.900 --> 16:51.570
What am I going to do with you?!

16:52.440 --> 16:55.710
I don't know what I am going to do with you, either!

16:55.710 --> 16:56.480
Chocolat!

16:56.880 --> 16:57.940
Vanilla-chama!

17:02.150 --> 17:03.920
It's Chocolat's fault!

17:03.920 --> 17:05.920
No! It's Vanilla's-kero!

17:05.920 --> 17:09.290
Stop saying "kero-kero" in my body!

17:09.290 --> 17:11.620
Then stop saying "chu-chu" in my body!

17:12.230 --> 17:15.800
You said it again!

17:18.430 --> 17:20.390
Ah-ha. I thought something strange was going on!

17:21.240 --> 17:23.600
So the topsy-turvy macaroons have done it again.

17:25.410 --> 17:28.670
I see, so Chocolat and Vanilla got in a fight.

17:29.380 --> 17:33.380
If we cast a magic spell on them, we
could have them make up in a snap.

17:33.910 --> 17:37.950
Mmh. But before that, let's listen
to what they have to say.

17:41.820 --> 17:42.620
I really blew it.

17:43.390 --> 17:46.030
I said such harsh things to Vanilla.

17:46.390 --> 17:47.830
It must have really hurt her.

17:52.030 --> 17:52.630
Vanilla?

17:55.200 --> 17:55.600
Hey.

17:56.840 --> 17:57.720
Saule.

18:00.240 --> 18:03.380
Chocolat-chan must be furious.

18:03.980 --> 18:07.150
Why did I say such mean things?

18:10.620 --> 18:11.480
Chocolat-chan?

18:14.120 --> 18:15.440
Hey, Vanilla.

18:16.360 --> 18:16.890
Houx.

18:17.990 --> 18:19.460
This is rare, isn't it?

18:20.060 --> 18:20.950
You two fighting.

18:21.430 --> 18:24.800
I didn't have her eat the macaroon on purpose.

18:25.200 --> 18:29.100
The idea that she would buy into
that so easily made me angry.

18:30.400 --> 18:36.880
For a moment, I really thought that maybe
Chocolat-chan fed me that macaroon on purpose.

18:36.880 --> 18:40.610
But immediately afterwards,
I knew it couldn't be true.

18:41.450 --> 18:43.050
And I was about to apologize.

18:43.880 --> 18:46.190
But then we started fighting.

18:46.190 --> 18:50.860
To be honest, after we ate the topsy-turvy
macaroons and I switched into Vanilla's body,

18:50.860 --> 18:54.030
I thought this was my chance to win a lot of hearts.

18:54.930 --> 18:57.110
I've always envied Vanilla.

18:57.110 --> 18:59.370
Winning hearts one after another,

18:59.370 --> 19:00.870
Her soft hair,

19:00.870 --> 19:03.040
Her doll-like cuteness.

19:03.840 --> 19:04.600
I see.

19:05.740 --> 19:10.440
But just being in Vanilla's body
wasn't enough to win hearts.

19:10.810 --> 19:13.710
It isn't just Vanilla's looks.

19:14.250 --> 19:18.150
I realized that it's her gentleness, her compassion.

19:20.020 --> 19:25.730
You know, when I switched into Chocolat-chan's
body, in my heart I was really happy.

19:26.490 --> 19:29.560
I've always wanted to be like Chocolat-chan.

19:30.060 --> 19:32.570
She's so trustworthy among her friends,

19:33.000 --> 19:34.770
With such shiny long hair,

19:35.100 --> 19:39.810
And so full of energy and vigor,
I was so envious of that.

19:40.340 --> 19:40.910
Vanilla.

19:42.010 --> 19:44.980
But even when in Chocolat-chan's body,

19:44.980 --> 19:47.610
I am still the same wimpy crybaby I always am.

19:48.120 --> 19:50.150
Chocolat-chan's really amazing.

19:50.750 --> 19:53.690
Today really made me realize that.

19:56.590 --> 19:57.930
So what are you gonna do?

19:57.930 --> 20:02.360
If you wish, we can cast a spell to
cool things off between you two.

20:04.130 --> 20:04.700
That's okay.

20:05.130 --> 20:07.430
I want to apologize to Vanilla myself.

20:07.970 --> 20:11.540
She may not forgive me, but...

20:11.940 --> 20:14.410
I want to stay friends with Vanilla
no mater what!

20:14.780 --> 20:16.710
Always! Friends forever!

20:19.510 --> 20:20.050
Vanilla!

20:33.130 --> 20:34.590
Vanilla! Sorry!

20:36.000 --> 20:38.090
Chocolat-chan! I'm sorry!

20:57.550 --> 20:58.650
We're back!

21:00.190 --> 21:02.020
We changed back, Chocolat-chan!

21:02.020 --> 21:03.650
Mmh! We changed back!

21:03.960 --> 21:05.660
Yeah!

21:06.130 --> 21:07.660
They returned.

21:08.000 --> 21:10.620
But we're still topsy-turvy-kero.

21:14.940 --> 21:16.540
Instructions, page three.

21:16.940 --> 21:19.510
If you don't have topsy-turvy macaroons on hand,

21:19.510 --> 21:22.580
If you hug the person with whom you have switched, You can return immediately.

21:24.470 --> 21:26.180
It says that?!

21:26.180 --> 21:27.680
It's that true, then Blanca and Duke--!

21:30.280 --> 21:33.790
You can't make me hug that tacky striped frog-chu!

21:33.790 --> 21:35.190
Hurry up and do it-kero!

21:35.660 --> 21:37.190
Shut up and do it!

21:37.190 --> 21:38.310
Nonononononono!

21:46.800 --> 21:49.400
I've changed back-kero!

21:51.240 --> 21:53.410
That was so creepy-chu!

21:54.040 --> 21:54.970
Thank goodness!

22:01.520 --> 22:04.620
Hey, we had one order of topsy-turvy
macaroons left in stock.

22:04.620 --> 22:05.750
So we brought it for ya.

22:06.820 --> 22:07.390
W–

22:07.720 --> 22:10.620
We don't need it! We don't need it!

22:10.620 --> 22:12.390
Refund! Refund! Refund the order!

22:23.190 --> 22:29.480
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.610 --> 22:30.980
"Love"

22:31.920 --> 22:35.420
A magic spell.

22:37.590 --> 22:44.860
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.290 --> 22:54.370
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:56.040 --> 23:00.310
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.910 --> 23:03.980
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.280 --> 23:11.350
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.720 --> 23:16.160
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.160 --> 23:26.270
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.330 --> 23:35.180
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.060 --> 23:49.210
Magic soldiers, gathering in the name of the Queen!

23:49.210 --> 23:50.700
Magic knights have arrived!

23:51.160 --> 23:53.670
Defeat the phantoms that are poised for attack!

23:53.670 --> 23:56.250
If anyone dares to defy the magic knights, I'll whup your butt!

23:56.950 --> 24:03.340
Who are these magic soldiers really?
Only you know the se-cr-et!

24:03.340 --> 24:06.320
Chocolat, who are you trying to be-kero?

24:06.320 --> 24:08.320
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.320 --> 24:10.320
Chocolat Becomes An Idol!

24:10.320 --> 24:11.750
Chocolat, an idol?!

24:11.750 --> 24:13.750
Are you kidding me?!
